tool.marquee.rect.description = Dosa wenze okukhethiweko okusikwere. U-Shift ekuthomeni kokudosa ungeza kokukhethiweko, u-alt uyasusa, bobabili benza ukuphambana; u-shift ngesikhathi sokudosa wenza isikwere esilingene mahlangothi. Ukuqhafaza ngaphandle kokudosa kususa okukhethiweko.
